	Adopted hatched lines and clipped to cell and canvas 
	via my library https://github.com/epibyte/p5-epi-shapesvg
	which enables also SVG-output -> press "S" 
	For colors the 60-30-10-rule is configured and implemented.

	Join the Birb's Nest Discord for friendly creative coding community
